   "fix": "Tag `extendCoordChange_apply` `@[simp]`. Add a public `analyticAt_extendCoordChange'` stated at `I (e x)` in ContMDiff/Analytic.lean, and use it in place of the repeated `simpa` terms.",
   "issue": "`ModelWithCorners.extendCoordChange_apply` is the basic base-point evaluation lemma for a change of charts but has no `@[simp]`. Its left side `I (e x)` is already simp-normal, and no Mathlib lemma covers it. Separately, `analyticAt_extendCoordChange` exists only at `e.extend I x`, so `simpa only [OpenPartialHomeomorph.extend_coe, comp_apply] using I.analyticAt_extendCoordChange \u2026` appears six times in ContMDiff/Germ.lean, including inside the public statements of `analyticGermsEquiv_apply` and `analyticGermsEquiv_of_contMDiffAt`.",
